eeebe92b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf345d718\" id=\"uf345d718\">运行主程序，通过各种方式把任务及任务参数通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u44a72799\" id=\"u44a72799\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0582f848\" id=\"u0582f848\">join_queue</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u83f06f7b\" id=\"u83f06f7b\">加入队列</span></li><li fid=\"u89023699\" data-lake-id=\"u6add6ce0\" id=\"u6add6ce0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3afcdbb\" id=\"ue3afcdbb\">等待多个任务执行完成。</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22main.py%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%E4%B8%BB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20TaskWorker%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%B0%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%5Cn%E5%BD%93%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8CTaskWorker%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%91%E5%87%BA%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%9A%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E3%80%82%5Cn%5Cn%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%201.%20%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20do_task%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%82%5Cn%202.%20%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BB%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%A7%BD%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%20on_result%20%E5%92%8C%20on_error%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%92%8C%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%87%BA%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E3%80%82%5Cn%203.%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20TaskWorker%20%E5%AE%9E